WEBVTT

00:00:24.660 --> 00:00:25.930
Why?

00:00:27.120 --> 00:00:28.220
Why?!

00:00:29.510 --> 00:00:31.610
This isn't the same as it was three years ago.

00:00:31.610 --> 00:00:33.880
This time, I prepared a path.

00:00:33.880 --> 00:00:36.300
I have a country for us to run to,

00:00:38.130 --> 00:00:39.430
Lieselotte.

00:00:41.330 --> 00:00:42.810
Mikhail...

00:00:49.920 --> 00:00:52.570
Let me take you away.

00:01:19.570 --> 00:01:20.720
Carmilla!

00:01:20.720 --> 00:01:22.080
I have a fighting chance now!

00:02:57.840 --> 00:03:00.440
You saved my life once.

00:03:00.960 --> 00:03:03.590
Without you, I wouldn't be here now.

00:03:04.360 --> 00:03:08.490
You want to repay your debt? This is too much—

00:03:08.490 --> 00:03:10.720
No. That's not all.

00:03:11.510 --> 00:03:13.060
That's not the whole story.

00:03:14.690 --> 00:03:15.680
I...

00:03:16.840 --> 00:03:18.300
I love you.

00:03:21.600 --> 00:03:22.940
Laugh if you want.

00:03:23.600 --> 00:03:28.740
We've only met twice and even then we spent less than an hour total together.

00:03:29.460 --> 00:03:33.690
Yet, I have fallen in love with you.

00:03:37.430 --> 00:03:38.690
Mikhail...

00:03:44.100 --> 00:03:48.090
You're so... young.

00:03:55.510 --> 00:03:59.060
I've seen the videos, but I didn't think it'd be this quiet.

00:03:59.060 --> 00:04:00.880
So this is the Rave Engine?

00:04:01.250 --> 00:04:05.140
Haruto, are you sure you want to leave it at that with your dad?

00:04:05.590 --> 00:04:06.860
Inuzuka...

00:04:08.760 --> 00:04:10.730
Yes. I am.

00:04:11.960 --> 00:04:15.430
They abandoned this amazing research environment!

00:04:15.430 --> 00:04:18.150
And they call themselves researchers?!

00:04:18.150 --> 00:04:23.600
We're granted all the funding we could ever want and never have to worry about standard medical regulations.

00:04:23.600 --> 00:04:27.620
Even human experimentation was available to us.

00:04:46.430 --> 00:04:47.520
What...

00:04:50.360 --> 00:04:52.440
Sorry. I'll let you out later.

00:04:52.440 --> 00:04:53.730
Don't move.

00:04:55.300 --> 00:04:57.610
What did you just do?

00:04:58.360 --> 00:05:02.610
You're Rukino Saki, one of the Valvrave pilots.

00:05:05.540 --> 00:05:07.600
There are several question I'd like to ask you.

00:05:14.050 --> 00:05:15.090
It's done.

00:05:16.320 --> 00:05:19.090
You are strong indeed.

00:05:19.730 --> 00:05:22.090
No, I'm weak.

00:05:23.700 --> 00:05:26.590
It took me ten years to get here.

00:05:27.000 --> 00:05:29.670
If only I were stronger, I wouldn't—

00:05:29.670 --> 00:05:31.600
L-Elf!

00:05:32.690 --> 00:05:37.980
Colonel Cain told me this is where the fun was.

00:05:38.680 --> 00:05:42.120
I'm glad I listened to him!

00:05:42.120 --> 00:05:45.740
Remember the last time we played with knives?

00:05:48.070 --> 00:05:51.260
You know. "Kill the traitor".

00:05:57.240 --> 00:05:58.060
What's going on?!

00:05:58.060 --> 00:05:58.750
Artillery?!

00:05:58.750 --> 00:05:59.910
They found out?!

00:05:59.910 --> 00:06:01.000
No way!

00:06:04.510 --> 00:06:06.610
We're surrounded by the Dorssian army!

00:06:06.610 --> 00:06:08.310
How did they find us?

00:06:08.310 --> 00:06:09.260
Shit!

00:06:09.600 --> 00:06:11.490
They blew up the runway!

00:06:11.490 --> 00:06:15.890
Oh, no! This shuttle can't take off without a runway!

00:06:16.640 --> 00:06:19.900
They've seen through our plan...

00:06:20.960 --> 00:06:24.650
I expected him to go after the shuttle in the museum.

00:06:25.670 --> 00:06:29.160
What a shame to have to destroy this beautiful building.

00:06:29.700 --> 00:06:31.460
The others were found.

00:06:31.460 --> 00:06:33.200
This wasn't planned!

00:06:33.200 --> 00:06:33.780
What now?

00:06:33.780 --> 00:06:35.860
The fight's already started.

00:06:35.860 --> 00:06:37.480
Ain't no time for hacking!

00:06:53.040 --> 00:06:54.220
Nice!

00:06:58.640 --> 00:07:00.500
Real nice!

00:07:06.030 --> 00:07:09.900
You're awesome, L-Elf! This is great!

00:07:09.900 --> 00:07:12.710
<i>If Q-Vier is here, then Cain must be around, too.</i>

00:07:12.710 --> 00:07:15.910
<i>That means he found out about the shuttle.</i>

00:07:17.190 --> 00:07:18.830
Think you've got time to look away?!

00:07:21.920 --> 00:07:23.540
H-Neun betrayed us, too!

00:07:23.870 --> 00:07:25.770
Just like you, L-Elf!

00:07:25.770 --> 00:07:27.090
Did you recruit him?

00:07:34.200 --> 00:07:35.470
L-Elf! Get in!

00:07:35.880 --> 00:07:36.970
Tokishima Haruto!

00:07:36.970 --> 00:07:37.970
Hurry!

00:07:38.350 --> 00:07:40.320
I'm fine! Take her!

00:07:40.320 --> 00:07:41.160
What about you?

00:07:41.160 --> 00:07:42.980
This is now a battle between Cain and me.

00:07:46.100 --> 00:07:47.480
This time, I can't afford to lose.

00:07:55.330 --> 00:07:56.870
Captain, where are you going?

00:07:57.830 --> 00:08:00.370
I need a bigger knife to fight that thing!

00:08:06.180 --> 00:08:07.250
L-Elf!

00:08:10.160 --> 00:08:11.070
The bridge...

00:08:11.840 --> 00:08:14.310
Tokishima Haruto, go to the museum!

00:08:14.310 --> 00:08:15.400
Don't let anything happen to her!

00:08:15.400 --> 00:08:16.620
Mikhail!

00:08:18.580 --> 00:08:21.520
Let's go. He seems to have a plan.

00:08:24.820 --> 00:08:25.630
Very well.

00:08:37.480 --> 00:08:40.250
Thank you, Tokishima Haruto.

00:08:41.700 --> 00:08:44.220
The boy who fights the world.

00:08:44.220 --> 00:08:44.920
Who's that?

00:08:46.640 --> 00:08:48.420
Who's that thing?

00:08:48.420 --> 00:08:50.240
"Thing"?

00:08:50.240 --> 00:08:52.300
That can't be the first human you've ever seen, is it?

00:08:52.610 --> 00:08:56.050
Human? No. She's the same as me.

00:08:56.050 --> 00:08:57.640
The same?

00:09:03.270 --> 00:09:04.720
She is correct.

00:09:06.250 --> 00:09:07.940
I am a Magius,

00:09:08.610 --> 00:09:11.680
a creature that has taken hold of a human body.

00:09:20.870 --> 00:09:24.460
<i>Lieselotte, this time, I will save you.</i>

00:09:25.380 --> 00:09:28.580
All combat-ready units are to pursue L-Elf.

00:09:29.040 --> 00:09:33.710
Even the mightiest of titans falls if beheaded.

00:09:36.790 --> 00:09:40.140
Please tell me about the Magius!

00:09:40.770 --> 00:09:45.640
We came to the Earth a few centuries ago.

00:09:46.720 --> 00:09:48.400
It was an unfortunate accident.

00:09:51.890 --> 00:09:55.430
We lost contact with the rest of our race and were left stranded.

00:09:57.060 --> 00:10:00.910
Our only prospect on this unknown planet was death.

00:10:01.750 --> 00:10:04.550
Instead, we chose to possess terrestrial life forms.

00:10:05.910 --> 00:10:07.240
Possess?

00:10:07.240 --> 00:10:14.650
We have no form. To stay alive, we need a body to house us.

00:10:14.650 --> 00:10:19.180
Me too! I also crashed here!

00:10:19.490 --> 00:10:20.410
Indeed.

00:10:20.920 --> 00:10:24.090
You're the same as us, aren't you?

00:10:24.090 --> 00:10:26.180
Then what about me?

00:10:26.180 --> 00:10:30.470
You seem to take after us.

00:10:30.470 --> 00:10:31.860
Probably intentionally.

00:10:33.490 --> 00:10:39.240
With the Valvraves, we are trying to create a new lifeform!

00:10:39.240 --> 00:10:44.120
That's right! You've surpassed humanity!

00:10:44.880 --> 00:10:50.120
We've lived on, passing from one body to another.

00:10:51.120 --> 00:10:54.130
Then you're a super granny?

00:11:03.720 --> 00:11:06.230
Otamaya, we can start any time, right?

00:11:06.230 --> 00:11:08.770
Sure, if we survive the take-off!

00:11:08.770 --> 00:11:11.000
They'll just gun us down the moment we exit!

00:11:11.000 --> 00:11:12.860
We can't do this! Let's just surrender!

00:11:12.860 --> 00:11:14.050
No!

00:11:14.050 --> 00:11:16.360
Don't give up until L-Elf comes back!

00:11:49.390 --> 00:11:51.040
Thanks, Tokishima!

00:11:51.040 --> 00:11:52.270
You made it!

00:12:43.940 --> 00:12:46.520
Over the course of our long, secret war against humanity

00:12:46.520 --> 00:12:48.740
we formed an organization:

00:12:49.910 --> 00:12:51.880
The Council of the Hundred and One.

00:12:52.840 --> 00:12:57.540
Only the most influential Magius and humans were chosen.

00:12:58.440 --> 00:13:03.540
Their purpose was to keep our existence secret from the public

00:13:03.540 --> 00:13:06.620
and securing the nutrients necessary to our survival.

00:13:06.620 --> 00:13:08.050
Nutritients?

00:13:08.420 --> 00:13:09.300
Runes!

00:13:09.840 --> 00:13:10.600
Yes.

00:13:11.440 --> 00:13:16.120
On this planet the only thing with large amounts of runes

00:13:16.120 --> 00:13:17.100
are humans.

00:13:19.110 --> 00:13:22.860
I live by consuming humans.

00:13:23.360 --> 00:13:24.970
I'm an enemy of mankind.

00:13:28.980 --> 00:13:31.950
Haruto! You okay?

00:13:37.830 --> 00:13:39.380
Leave the rest to us!

00:13:39.380 --> 00:13:41.100
Yamada! But—

00:13:41.100 --> 00:13:42.880
Fall back for now, Tokishima!

00:13:43.200 --> 00:13:45.610
Keep your heat low by taking turns!

00:13:45.610 --> 00:13:47.060
Inuzuka's here, too!

00:13:47.060 --> 00:13:49.500
He has the prisoners with him!

00:13:49.500 --> 00:13:51.390
Okay! Open the hatch!

00:13:51.390 --> 00:13:52.140
Otamaya!

00:14:27.220 --> 00:14:31.220
It's no good! The Impact Booster can't cool it enough!

00:14:31.220 --> 00:14:32.790
That was the last of 'em!

00:14:32.790 --> 00:14:34.050
Shit!

00:14:34.050 --> 00:14:36.000
So it's weak to heat?

00:14:36.000 --> 00:14:39.570
Flying in the atmosphere generates way too much heat!

00:14:42.310 --> 00:14:44.260
Oh, this?

00:14:44.260 --> 00:14:45.530
What is that?

00:14:45.530 --> 00:14:49.770
I got it because I rejected the Council of the Hundred and One.

00:14:50.630 --> 00:14:56.420
This is my punishment for trying to reveal the truth and coexist with humanity.

00:14:56.420 --> 00:14:57.460
Punishment?

00:14:58.790 --> 00:15:01.500
My runes are drained at regular intervals.

00:15:01.990 --> 00:15:05.850
Which means I'm constantly on the brink of death.

00:15:06.720 --> 00:15:10.260
I'm glad I could talk with you, but it's time for us to part.

00:15:11.040 --> 00:15:11.870
But—

00:15:11.870 --> 00:15:16.920
Mikhail wouldn't have gone unless I went with you.

00:15:16.920 --> 00:15:19.270
So you did this for L-Elf?

00:15:19.880 --> 00:15:23.640
He told me he loved me.

00:15:24.580 --> 00:15:29.780
But I'm a Magius. I cannot be with humans.

00:15:41.620 --> 00:15:43.750
Th-That's not true!

00:15:44.530 --> 00:15:48.310
Please! You can't write it off like that!

00:15:48.310 --> 00:15:50.510
L-Elf wouldn't want that!

00:15:50.950 --> 00:15:54.670
I'm sure he could make you happy!

00:15:54.670 --> 00:15:56.300
He's amazing.

00:15:56.300 --> 00:15:59.220
He's so smart and cool-headed that it enrages me.

00:15:59.220 --> 00:15:59.890
So please!

00:16:04.320 --> 00:16:06.360
Mikhail is very fortunate.

00:16:06.820 --> 00:16:08.900
He has great friends.

00:16:17.350 --> 00:16:20.080
Damn it! You piss me off!

00:16:20.470 --> 00:16:22.010
Yamada, don't try to fly!

00:16:22.010 --> 00:16:23.570
If you overheat, we're done for!

00:16:23.570 --> 00:16:25.210
I have bigger problems right now!

00:16:25.540 --> 00:16:27.490
We can't just keep on providing cover!

00:16:27.490 --> 00:16:29.830
We have to wait for L-Elf's directions!

00:16:29.830 --> 00:16:30.970
Where's Mr. Kibukawa?

00:16:30.970 --> 00:16:33.570
In the hangar! He's running a check on the shuttle!

00:16:35.400 --> 00:16:36.680
It's L-Elf!

00:16:38.720 --> 00:16:40.140
Has Unit 1 returned?

00:16:40.140 --> 00:16:41.950
Yes, but the enemy—

00:16:41.950 --> 00:16:43.980
Change of course, Renbokoji.

00:16:44.660 --> 00:16:47.350
Head east and use the road as a runway.

00:16:47.350 --> 00:16:49.910
We can't. There's a river to the east.

00:16:49.910 --> 00:16:51.360
The runway won't be long enough!

00:16:51.650 --> 00:16:54.760
If we lower the drawbridge, it'll connect the road on the other bank.

00:16:54.760 --> 00:16:56.010
How do we do that?

00:16:56.010 --> 00:16:58.260
Leave that to me. Just do it!

00:16:58.870 --> 00:17:00.940
Is the other side of the bridge fine?

00:17:00.940 --> 00:17:02.830
It's a country road, but it should work.

00:17:02.830 --> 00:17:04.540
Let's believe in L-Elf.

00:17:05.090 --> 00:17:07.540
Guys, we're changing course.

00:17:07.540 --> 00:17:09.540
We'll use the road to the east as our runway.

00:17:09.880 --> 00:17:10.930
But—

00:17:10.930 --> 00:17:13.140
L-Elf will lower the bridge for us.

00:17:13.140 --> 00:17:15.030
That's gonna be our runway!

00:17:15.030 --> 00:17:16.180
Turn us around!

00:17:16.180 --> 00:17:18.220
Unit 5, smash through the wall!

00:17:18.600 --> 00:17:21.730
L-Elf! You never fail to amaze me.

00:17:21.730 --> 00:17:25.230
But what's gonna happen to Mikhail?

00:17:48.840 --> 00:17:51.000
I win, Cain.

00:17:58.140 --> 00:18:00.390
The drawbridge's moving!

00:18:00.900 --> 00:18:03.640
I see. So that was his plan.

00:18:04.550 --> 00:18:07.190
Well done, L-Elf.

00:18:07.190 --> 00:18:09.400
You know this city well.

00:18:16.370 --> 00:18:18.040
Let's go! Can you fly?

00:18:18.040 --> 00:18:19.920
Yeah! I'm good to go!

00:18:34.730 --> 00:18:36.810
You're not getting away!

00:18:40.390 --> 00:18:41.760
It's fast!

00:18:50.260 --> 00:18:52.900
Get away, Lieselotte.

00:18:56.630 --> 00:18:58.060
Tokishima Haruto?

00:18:58.060 --> 00:18:59.400
Have you lost your mind?!

00:19:01.200 --> 00:19:04.660
I know how it feels to want to save someone!

00:19:11.000 --> 00:19:13.420
Löwenglitzen!

00:19:14.380 --> 00:19:17.380
The hell?! The aim's off!

00:19:17.840 --> 00:19:19.630
No, that will do.

00:19:21.640 --> 00:19:23.340
One of the hydrogen tanks took a hit!

00:19:23.340 --> 00:19:26.190
We won't have enough thrust to escape the atmosphere!

00:19:26.190 --> 00:19:28.270
It's gonna explode! Disconnect it!

00:19:28.270 --> 00:19:31.690
No! If we lose altitude, they'll shoot us down!

00:19:32.040 --> 00:19:33.650
What now?!

00:19:33.650 --> 00:19:34.940
I don't wanna die!

00:19:37.600 --> 00:19:39.610
Can you use Unit 1 to push it?

00:19:39.610 --> 00:19:42.240
I can't! I'm too close to overheating already!

00:19:42.800 --> 00:19:45.500
Mikhail, I feel the same way.

00:20:01.700 --> 00:20:03.660
The curse of diffusion breakdown...

00:20:04.230 --> 00:20:05.510
That won't stop me!

00:20:11.520 --> 00:20:13.150
The light from a Valvrave?

00:20:13.150 --> 00:20:14.310
Is it one of the other units?

00:20:15.230 --> 00:20:20.070
<i>Mikhail, I was truly happy...</i>

00:20:35.680 --> 00:20:38.340
<i>...that you told me you loved me.</i>

00:20:44.890 --> 00:20:46.110
Hang in there!

00:20:47.030 --> 00:20:50.810
<i>We are beings not of the body, but the soul.</i>

00:20:51.600 --> 00:20:56.170
<i>Yet I never fully understood what "love" meant for humans.</i>

00:20:57.520 --> 00:21:01.610
<i>But thanks to you,</i>

00:21:02.600 --> 00:21:05.220
<i>I think I do now.</i>

00:21:18.160 --> 00:21:21.550
That light... Is it Lieselotte?

00:21:23.220 --> 00:21:24.880
Reach!

00:21:39.230 --> 00:21:40.570
Mikhail...

00:21:41.960 --> 00:21:43.240
I...

00:21:53.350 --> 00:21:57.670
I wanted to love you back...

00:22:35.800 --> 00:22:38.310
Lieselotte!

00:24:12.380 --> 00:24:15.220
PREVIEW

00:24:14.340 --> 00:24:18.720
Next time, episode 20: The Holy Spirits Exposed.

00:24:19.720 --> 00:24:24.900
Valvrave the Liberator... The system that unveils the world.

00:24:24.900 --> 00:24:27.400
EPISODE 20

00:24:24.900 --> 00:24:27.400
The Holy Spirits Exposed
